This product includes software developed as an independent,
clean-room reimplementation of the concept of an embedded S3 mock
server. It is functionally inspired by findify/s3mock
(https://github.com/findify/s3mock), which is distributed under the
MIT License. No source code from that project is included here.

The AWS SDK for Java v2 is used exclusively in the test scope and is
not redistributed as part of S3Forge.
